# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository AND the working tree.
#
# The global core.autocrlf=true rewrites every text file to CRLF on checkout,
# which turns into a full-file diff on every Windows edit and silently changes
# the bytes of files that are line-ending sensitive (CI workflow, .mjs, .json).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
